### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "thanh",
  "email": "thanh@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van Thanh",
  "phone": "0123456789",
  "address": "Ha Noi"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "thanh",
  "password": "123456"
}